OL,3,GNEWSAFury v Joshua road closures and   
OL,4,Atravel advice ahead of Cardiff fight   
OL,6,FPeople travelling to Cardiff for the   
OL,7,Fanticipated Tyson Fury v Anthony Joshua
OL,8,Ffight, which is expected to finish in  
OL,9,Fthe early hours, have been urged to    
OL,10,Fplan ahead.                            
OL,12,FFans in hospitality boxes at the       
OL,13,FPrincipality Stadium on 11 December    
OL,14,Fwill be allowed to drink alcohol until 
OL,15,F03:00 GMT the following day, with the  
OL,16,Fvenue closing at 03:30 to align with   
OL,17,Fprime time viewing in the US.          
OL,19,FTrain operators have announced         
OL,20,Fovernight services for the first time  
OL,21,Fto help boxing fans get home after the 
OL,22,Fevent.                                 
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
