OL,3,GNEWSAFury v Joshua road closures and   
OL,4,Atravel advice ahead of Cardiff fight   
OL,6,FPeople have also been advised that road
OL,7,Fclosures will be in place around the   
OL,8,Fstadium from 16:00 GMT on 11 December  
OL,9,Funtil 05:00 on 12 December.            
